<?php

namespace Database\Seeders\QualificaCatalog;

/**
 * The client's reporters ("Segnalatori 2026", user directives 2026-10-30 and
 * 2026-11-03) and their commission percentages. Pure data, read by
 * QualificaReporterCommissionSeeder, which makes the database converge on it:
 * edit a rate here and re-run the seeder to change it.
 *
 * A reporter already in the legacy system is identified by its legacy id
 * (`old_id`, the match on the NOME column confirmed by the user 2026-10-30:
 * companies and joint names in NOME are not the anagraphic name); the others
 * carry the anagraphic needed to create them and are matched by that name.
 * `supervisor`, `contact` (the REFERENTE column, when it differs from NOME)
 * and `note` compose the referent's notes. `row` is the source spreadsheet
 * row, kept for traceability. Corrections agreed with the user: row 7 GDPR
 * "1%" read as 15%, row 21 FNC "20" read as 20%, row 50 FNC "NO" = no rule,
 * the PAL column applied as APL (always the same value); row 53 (duplicate
 * of row 78, Francesco Lagana') dropped.
 */
